The incident involves the distribution of a malicious document "зміни оплата праці з нарахуваннями.docx" targeting Ukrainian state organizations via email. The document exploits vulnerabilities CVE-2021-40444 and CVE-2022-30190 to run PowerShell commands, download "ms-msdt.exe" from the domain "nod-update[.]it", and deploy Cobalt Strike Beacon.

